id: recall
name: Recall
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Knowledge
# Any of Knowledge's three, each a Skill of its own - and which, asked when it is used.
requiresSkill: knowledge, knowledgeProfession, knowledgeHistory
requiresRanks: 2
asksKnowledge: true
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 1 Minute
# The information is the ARC's to give: said on the card - with the Knowledge picked.
effectNote: recalls a piece of information related to their chosen Specialty ({knowledge}) that may help with the current situation
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A minute's thought: a piece of information from your Knowledge Specialty that may help right now.
text: >
  Recall: You wrack your memory for relevant information to present to your comrades.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Knowledge
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 1 Minute
  –Effect: You recall a piece of information related to your chosen Specialty that may help with your
  current situation.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in any Knowledge - which, asked where they have
# more than one (the user's ruling). The card's button, once the minute is spent, says what it does and
# names that Knowledge; what they recall is the ARC's.
